Z||000000||Philphine||01-05-2001||11:15 AM||||<BR>when i got home from work last night and checked email i had a bunch of undeliverable email messages for a car sale. i'm not a car sales man and have no idea why i'm considered the sender. notified webtv 'cause i'm compleatly baffled. anything like this happen to anybody else. got two more when i logged on this morning. since my name is in the ender spot it's like i some how spammed myself.||||reg||1
